hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"294","A chapter on misappropriation of spoils (ghulul): Ibn al-Muthanna narrated to us, Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi narrated to us, from Mansur ibn Abi al-Aswad, from al-A'mash, from Shimr, from Abu Hazim, he said: The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) was brought a leather mat from the spoils, and it was said: O Messenger of Allah, this is for you, to shade yourself from the sun with. He said: Would you like your Prophet to be shaded by a mat of the Fire?"
